== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: vgatherpf0dps [ENC: EVEX, MAP: 0F38, OPC: 0xC6]
     LENGTH:  7
        SSZ: 64
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 64
   CATEGORY: GATHER
    ISA-SET: AVX512PF_512
    ISA-EXT: AVX512EVEX
 EXCEPTIONS: E12NP
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM HAS_SIB HAS_EVEX ACCEPTS_SEGMENT 
  OPTIMIZED: 62 F2 7D 49 C6 0C 00 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0     MEMORY    EXPLICIT       R      MODRM_RM     32      1      32   FLOAT32  TYPE  =                VSIB
                                                                                 SEG   =                  ds
                                                                                 BASE  =                 rax
                                                                                 INDEX =                zmm0
                                                                                 SCALE =                   1
                                                                                 DISP  =  0x0000000000000000
 1   REGISTER    EXPLICIT       R          MASK     64     64       1       INT                           k1
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [      AVX ] ============================================================================================
  VECTORLEN: 512
  BROADCAST: NONE
   ROUNDING: NONE
        SAE: N
       MASK: k1 [MERGING]

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: vgatherpf0dps (%rax,%zmm0,1) {%k1}
   RELATIVE: vgatherpf0dps (%rax,%zmm0,1) {%k1}

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: vgatherpf0dps dword ptr ds:[rax+zmm0*1] {k1}
   RELATIVE: vgatherpf0dps dword ptr ds:[rax+zmm0*1] {k1}

== [ SEGMENTS ] ============================================================================================
62 F2 7D 49 C6 0C 00 
